- `GET /outlookcopilot/mailIntelligence/v2.0/copilotsettings` — Get Copilot settings for mail intelligence.
- `GET /outlookcopilot/mailIntelligence/v4.0/copilotUserPreferences` — Get Copilot user preferences.
- `GET /owa/notificationchannel/{notificationchannelId}` — Get details for a specific notification channel.
