- `GET /ows/beta/TeamsMeeting/policies` — Get Teams meeting policies.
- `GET /ows/v1.0/CalendarIcons/` — Get calendar icons.
- `GET /ows/v1.0/lightning/items/unseen` — Get unseen lightning items.
- `GET /ows/v1.0/OutlookOptions` — Retrieve Outlook options and settings.
- `GET /ows/v2.0/ActivityFeed` — Get the user's activity feed.
- `GET /txpb2/api/v1.1/me/UserSettings` — Get the user's settings.
- `GET /v4/api/selection` — Retrieve selection information.

### Data Write (8)
