- `POST /OneCollector/1.0/` — Post telemetry data to OneCollector.
- `POST /owa/{owaId}` — Send data to Outlook Web App (OWA) for writing actions.
- `POST /owa/published/service.svc` — Post data to a published service (likely legacy).
- `POST /ows/api/v1/EndpointTracker` — Track endpoint usage.
- `POST /ows/beta/Acquisitions/AppBarTiles` — Add app bar tiles.

